<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quintiles a Lehman buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quintiles a Lehman buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Jerome Brimeyer initiated coverage off Quintiles Transnational Corp with a buy rating and a 12-month price target in the mid-$70s.</p>
<p>-- The company is a contract research organization, contracting with pharmaceutical, biotechnology and medical device companies.</p>
<p>-- Its shares were up 1/4 at 58-1/4.</p>
</text>
